3.4.3 Unsupported Features
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

The following feature is not supported and not validated.

  x Intel Software Guard Extensions (SGX)
  x Audio device [0403]: Intel Corporation Device [8086:1bc8]

There is no external interface for audio device on server platform. So this feature
is not validated.

3.4.4 Notes
~~~~~~~~~~~

1) In order to support QAT device on Sapphire Rapids, you need to enable feature/intel-qat
and set the following PREFERRED_PROVIDER before building.

  PREFERRED_PROVIDER_virtual/qat = "qat20"
  PREFERRED_PROVIDER_virtual/lib32-qat = "qat20"
or
  PREFERRED_PROVIDER_virtual/qat = "qatlib"
  PREFERRED_PROVIDER_virtual/lib32-qat = "qatlib"

Please read templates/feature/intel-qat/README first.

2) Default console serial port is ttyS0 at I/O 0x3f8.

3.4.5 Known Issue
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

See 4) in Section of Common Known Issues.

