3.5.4 Known Issues
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

When using ACPI S4, kernel cannot exit from hibernation and the terminal hangup without any output. This is due to driver of
VGA controller Millennium G550. If you want to use ACPI S4, change another card or block probing the driver by adding
"modprobe.blacklist=matroxfb_base" to boot parameters.

